{"data":{"body":"**P1:** This abort drains only `delayedBatch` and `flushingQueue`; items already removed into `flushQueue`'s local `flushingItems` remain unresolved if `executeBatch` is blocked. Shutdown can then block behind the backend call (including the `CheckpointManager` polling lock) until Lambda times out. Track and fail the active batch on terminal abort, and make terminal shutdown avoid joining that in-flight backend work. Cover an external abort during a blocked `executeBatch`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76gLUc","finding_digest":"9f673fbc532d3bb319a37ac6eed85cfafbe8a874746fdee211ea91ae64b5c677","finding_id":"arf_v1_t5tt7pctfu53ggndpldo5wc47l","finding_key":"sdk/execution/async-request-delayed-batcher::abort-pending::inflight-items-not-failed","identity_key":"sdk/execution/async-request-delayed-batcher::abort-pending::inflight-items-not-failed","line":274,"observation_digest":"5e86bcd71a67e8841b9a0857c555dc03187ded6472ca2bd251a3767951047e1c","observation_id":"aro_v1_l2dlzvy2m7uiig42bbl4kvo4am","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ApiRequestDelayedBatcher.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_t5tt7pctfu53ggndpldo5wc47l","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:22:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vwqkwiy72tlizudgfzrvf5lwtb","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"8f9a53bee6bf441644366ee4b1dce8df1a59265b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":269,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_div6ab2u6gqx5oiyh6fz6fynli","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:22:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
